{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": ""}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Secondary Storage Devices"}, {"type": "position", "content": 4}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 1}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you hear and use to talk about secondary usage devices."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Build the user interface, supported on the prototype assessment, determining the inputs and outputs required in the design and defining the navigation guidelines, according to the user's needs.  Identifies different hardware components and peripheral devices."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.  Exchanges simple information on the hardware devices and the architecture of a system to create the IT solution."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "enpe8n6le01ob04re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "storage"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an electronic space designed to save data"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The primary storage isn't designed to store files for a long time. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n6le01ob04aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "usage"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "way in which something is used"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You must take into account the usage of each device."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n6le01ob04aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "data "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "information represented electronically "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Secondary storage devices are items that you can use to save your data."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n6le01ob04aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "mean"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "way in which something is handled"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: They are practical means of storing data."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n6le01ob04aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "hard disk "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "storage device that computers have "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: it says that the hard disk has been filled up."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n6le01ob04aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "portable"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "when something can be taken from one place to another"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (adjective) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I will buy a portable hard disk with plenty of space to back everything up."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n6le01ob04aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Look for information about secondary storage devices"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Make a chart in which you write the devices that people used to use to save information and the devices that people have today."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a description in front of each device."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Share you chart with a partner. "}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I search information about secondary storage devices."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I make a char to compare some devices. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a description for each device."}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Simple Present Passive - Negative Form"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the <span class=\"strong\"> simple present passive in negative  </span> statements to express that something doesn't happen frequently."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The <span class=\"strong\"> simple present passive in negative  </span> statements is commonly used when the subject of the sentence can be omitted since it is implicit in the message. If you want to mention the subject, you complement the sentence using \"<span class=\"strong\">by</span> \" followed by the noun.  <br/><br/> Let's compare these two sentences:  <br/><br/> <span class=\"strong\"> Active voice: </span>  <br/><br/> <span class=\"italic\"> The computer does not use secondary storage devices to store drivers. </span>  <br/><br/> <span class=\"strong\"> Passive voice: </span>  <br/><br/> <span class=\"italic\"> Secondary storage devices <span class=\"strong\"> aren't used </span> (by the computer) to store drivers. </span>  <br/><br/> As you can see, in the <span class=\"strong\"> passive voice </span> sentence the subject \u201ccomputers\u201d is not necessary.  <br/><br/> The grammatical structure that we follow for the passive voice in the negative form is: <br/><br/> <div class=\"center_text\"> Object of the sentence + <span class=\"strong\"> <span class=\"strong\"> verb 'to be' + (not)</span> </span> + verb in past participle.</div> <br/><br/>  For example: <br/><br/> <span class=\"italic\"> Secondary storage devices <span class=\"strong\"> are not designed </span> to be the main storage method. <br/> Nowadays, paper tapes, punched cards, and magnetic tapes <span class=\"strong\"> aren't used </span> to save information. </span> "}, {"type": "example", "content": "The primary storage isn't designed to store files for a long time."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Secondary storage devices aren't only used to save data."}, {"type": "example", "content": "All files aren't stored unless you use a secondary storage device."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Secondary Storage Devices"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use <span class=\"strong\"> secondary storage devices  </span> to hold data for a long period of time."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Computers need to have a way to store data and instructions. However, once the computer gets powered off, all data is cleared. When we use a <span class=\"strong\"> secondary storage device</span>, data will stay in the memory for more time. <br/><br/>  These devices are also called external storage or auxiliary storage in order to distinguish them from the primary electronic storage ones. In the past, people used to use paper tapes, punched cards, and magnetic tapes to save information. Nowadays, we use hard disks, optical discs, flash drives or different portable devices to store a large amount of data."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Usages\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Advantages\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Saving files\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Non-volatile devices\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Back up information\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Storage is expandable and portable\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Transport files\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Data is easily distributed\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Store large amounts of data\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If one device gets filled, another one can be added.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Examples of secondary storage\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Hard disks, CDs, DVDs, flash drives, Portable devices, zip disks.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}], "type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"id": 0, "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "type": "welcome", "template_override": 1}, {"_data": [], "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "enpe8n6le01ob04re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "enpe8n6le01ob04re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">George:</span> You look worried, is everything ok? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Karen:</span> The hard disk icon in my computer has been showing a red bar, it says that the hard disk has been filled up. I definitely need more space in my disk. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">George:</span> You should get another secondary storage device to transfer some data and get some free space. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Karen:</span> What do you mean by secondary storage device?"}, {"time": "19000", "image": "enpe8n6le01ob04re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">George:</span> Secondary storage devices are items that you can use to save your data. Some people call them auxiliary or external devices. Most computers come with a hard disk to achieve digital information storage permanently since the primary storage isn't designed to store files for a long time. <br/> Once you turn your computer off, all files aren't stored unless you use a secondary storage device. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Karen:</span> What device should I use, then? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">George:</span> It depends, there are different types of secondary storage such as flash drives, CDs, DVDs, portable devices like MP3, iPods, among others. They are practical means of storing data. Choose the one that you like the most."}, {"time": "61300", "image": "enpe8n6le01ob04re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\"> Karen:</span> Well, I've been transferring some files from my computer to some empty DVDs and I've used flash drives for this purpose as well. However, I have so many files. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">George:</span> You must take into account the usage of each device. Secondary storage devices aren't only used to save data. People have been using them to back up important information, to distribute data to other people or to carry it with themselves everywhere, just in case they need it. People have used these devices to store files for long-term preservation. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Karen:</span> I certainly don't need to carry all that information with me all the time. I will buy a portable hard disk with plenty of space to back everything up. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">George:</span> Good idea!"}], "coverimg": "enpe8n6le01ob04re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1, "id": 1, "title": ""}, {"_data": [], "contents": [{"value": "pin ball 01.jpg", "type": "img"}, {"value": "pin ball 03.jpg", "type": "img"}], "type": "static", "template_override": 1, "id": 2, "title": ""}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "exercises": [{"stimuli_ids": [0], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about secondary storage devices."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "  I can explain which are the secondary storage devices usages."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "What storage devices do you know?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "What are the most common storage devices people use to store files?"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content